# OPIc Sample Answer — Day51

## Hotel Room Problem

> Hello, I’m calling because I have a problem with my hotel room.
>
> I booked a non-smoking room, but the room smells strongly of smoke.
>
> I was wondering if you could change my room.
>
> Would it be possible to move me to another room on the same floor?
>
> If that is not possible, could you send someone to check the room?
>
> I hope you can help me solve this problem. Thank you.

---

## Useful Expressions

### I'm calling because I have a problem with ~.

~에 문제가 있어서 전화드렸어요.

### The room smells strongly of smoke.

방에서 담배 냄새가 심하게 나요.

### I was wondering if you could change my room.

방을 바꿔주실 수 있을까 해서요.

### Would it be possible to ~?

~하는 것이 가능할까요?

### If that is not possible, could you ~?

그게 불가능하다면 ~해주실 수 있을까요?

